# Loot tables architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/loot-tables.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/loot-tables.md).

**Permanent decision:** reusable **`LootTable`** catalog rows; **server** RNG +
idempotent grants; **personal loot** default in shared PVE; callers (mobs,
chests, mission packs) pass `lootTableId` only. Tiny ARC OK; **never AC**.
Nesting depth ≤ 3. Entry gates may use level / reputation.
[Mobs](../../docs/docs/architecture/mobs.md),
[Missions](../../docs/docs/architecture/missions.md),
[Progression](../../docs/docs/architecture/progression.md),
[Factions](../../docs/docs/architecture/factions.md).

When changing drop rolls, corpse claim, loot UI grants, or Console loot CRUD,
read the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
